      "mark_scheme_html": "<p>Marked by level of response. Top-level answers are detailed, well organised and reach a supported judgement.</p>\n<p>Indicative content:</p>\n<ul><li>Advantages: fewer food miles, fresher produce, support for local farmers and the local economy</li><li>Disadvantages: less choice, sometimes higher prices, limited availability out of season</li><li>Environmental points: heated greenhouses may use more energy than imports</li><li>A balanced conclusion</li></ul>",
